key-cite is part of Key (MIT). The CSL styles and locales it renders with are not part of
this crate: they are shipped as separate, unmodified data files under their own licence
(CC BY-SA 3.0); see data/citation/NOTICE. The fallback style and English terms in
src/fallback/ were written for Key and are MIT.

Citations are rendered with hayagriva (https://github.com/typst/hayagriva) and
citationberg (https://github.com/typst/citationberg), both MIT OR Apache-2.0. A copy of
hayagriva 0.10.1 with one fix lives in vendor/hayagriva (its LICENSE-MIT,
LICENSE-APACHE and NOTICE files are kept there).
